sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Web / mobile client
    participant B as ASP.NET Core API
    participant D as Backend PostgreSQL
    participant W as Backend analysis worker
    participant A as FastAPI compatibility API
    participant Q as AI durable state + Redis/RQ
    participant G as AI worker

    C->>B: POST /api/projects/{projectId}/ai/runs
    B->>D: Validate project/documents and persist AnalysisRun
    D-->>B: QUEUED run state
    B->>W: Start current processing task
    W->>W: Recover and combine backend-owned document text
    W->>A: POST /internal/process (Bearer token)
    A->>Q: Validate, fingerprint, persist and dispatch
    Q->>G: Execute attempt
    G->>G: Run 13-node graph and persist terminal result
    loop Authoritative backend polling
        W->>A: GET /internal/jobs/{jobId}
        A-->>W: Status and progress
    end
    W->>A: GET /internal/jobs/{jobId}/result
    A-->>W: Terminal JobResult payload
    W->>D: Persist AnalysisResult.RawJson and terminal state
    C->>B: Poll run status / request results dashboard
    B->>D: Read project-scoped run and result
    D-->>B: Durable application state
    B-->>C: Normalized status, evidence and result

    Note over A,G: Protected internal jobs remain the production-oriented AI contract.
